    <subfield code="a">"A series of poems from life within the chaos of Argentina. As my vegetable garden grows, I watch inside and I watch outside and these are the words found in my sierra town, in the day, in this country tumbling through a nervous breakdown. " Alex Appella.</subfield>
  </datafield>
